{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goons of Fortune is an Rogue-Lite RTS-Lite where you take command of a gang  in suburbia. Claw your way to the top by growing your gangs holdings, leveling up your leaders and throwing down the powers of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player campaign with a dynamic map that updates in real time as you and rival gangs vie for control over the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friend to join and help you with online co-op- Coming Soon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new outfits to customise your gang leaders and silly costumes to dress up your gang in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players in online head to head matches and rise up the rankings or compete for control of Goonsville in a large scale multiplayer war game style map.- Coming soon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will conduct your business at night under the cover of darkness, but be weary of the Coppas that come out  to nab you and your goons. Crush your rivals, conquer neighbourhoods and take over the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929290?t=1764829702","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929290/33003a24801481fd20b413c7bce68da2ecf8f8b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764829702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929290/6ea5762938bfe2ab6318395a4cfd009765656f9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764829702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929290/6ea5762938bfe2ab6318395a4cfd009765656f9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764829702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goons of Fortune is an Rogue-Lite RTS-Lite where you take command of a gang  in suburbia. Claw your way to the top by growing your gangs holdings, leveling up your leaders and throwing down the powers of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player campaign with a dynamic map that updates in real time as you and rival gangs vie for control over the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friend to join and help you with online co-op- Coming Soon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new outfits to customise your gang leaders and silly costumes to dress up your gang in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players in online head to head matches and rise up the rankings or compete for control of Goonsville in a large scale multiplayer war game style map.- Coming soon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will conduct your business at night under the cover of darkness, but be weary of the Coppas that come out  to nab you and your goons. Crush your rivals, conquer neighbourhoods and take over the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mini Mammoth Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929290/d827fd9cce1c870c8dd5f195e8229b56b7cafa7f/header.jpg?t=1764829702","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto